        {
          "path": "_m/t/k/r/t/pakistan-air-force-museum-wp/fs-hussain-and-zhou-enlai-1956.png",
          "filename": "FS Hussain and Zhou Enlai (1956).png",
          "caption": "FS Hussain gained renewed fame on 22 December 1956, when he captivated the Karachi crowd with his signature slow roll and inverted pull-up at low altitude. Among the spectators was the Chinese leader, Zhou Enlai, on his inaugural official visit to Pakistan. So impressed by the dazzling aerobatics, Premier Zhou Enlai requested an audience with the President of Pakistan asking if he could personally meet F. S. Hussain &amp; commend him for his remarkable performance.",
